# deploy/light/.env.infisical — the self-hosted Infisical server's OWN secrets
# (--profile infisical). Copy this file to .env.infisical, uncomment the three
# keys and generate each one.
# Only the infisical and infisical-db services load this file; the engine never
# sees it (#2577). The engine's Infisical CLIENT settings (INFISICAL_HOST,
# INFISICAL_CLIENT_ID, ...) stay in .env. One value per line, no inline comments.

# INFISICAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY=<openssl rand -hex 16>
# INFISICAL_AUTH_SECRET=<openssl rand -base64 32>
# INFISICAL_DB_PASSWORD=<openssl rand -hex 16>
